WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.875
This is Cloisto. It lets you use AI on client work, while your clients’ details stay on your computer.

00:00:07.575 --> 00:00:10.950
First: asking an AI about a client file.

00:00:11.902 --> 00:00:16.877
Drop in a file. Here, an email thread about payroll, made up for this film.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:24.031
Cloisto reads it on your computer, and replaces every name, email address and phone number with a code.

00:00:24.596 --> 00:00:30.246
Drag across to compare. Your file is on the left. What the AI will see is on the right.

00:00:32.041 --> 00:00:37.516
Point at a code to see what it stands for. The same person always gets the same code.

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:44.339
Now ask your question. Only the codes leave your computer.

00:00:45.463 --> 00:00:51.788
The AI answers with the codes, and Cloisto puts the real names back in, here on your computer.
